Upon meeting with the [[Huntik Foundation Council]], [[Dante Vale]]'s team were sent on a mission by [[Teien Casterwill]] to activate the Blue Star and to bring the Casterwill family members out of hiding. Following the quatrains on [[Eathon Lambert]]'s [[Holotome]], [[Lok Lambert]] managed to acquire the [[Ring]] of [[Quetzalcoatl]] from the [[Pyramid of the Sun]] in the ruins of [[Teotihuacan, Mexico]]. Upon summoning the Titan and saving his teammates from [[Kiel]] and the [[Blood Spirals]], Lok transformed Quetzalcoatl into the Blue Star. {{Source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

With the Blue Star high in the heavens, the scattered members of the Casterwill family reunited at the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

When Lok fell into a [[Inter-dimensional World|gap between dimensions]] while exploring [[Tír na nÓg]], he spoke with his father, [[Eathon Lambert]], who hinted to Lok that the Blue Star would be necessary when confronting [[the Betrayer]]. {{source|Back Home}}

During the battle against the Betrayer and the Legendary Titan of Betrayal, [[Demigorgan]], Lok transformed the Blue Star back into [[Quetzalcoatl]]. {{Source|Dante's Return}}
